{"4437450":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Nekopara Sekai Connect","steam_appid":4437450,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartwarming Neko comedy that connects these felines from all across the globe!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 7 million copies sold worldwide, the latest entry<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in the popular adventure game series NEKOPARA is here!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆About NEKOPARA Sekai Connect (Neko Connect)<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Planning, main story, character design, and illustrations all handled by original creator Sayori herself!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nekos from all around the world appear, each with their own character story!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High-quality 2D animation bringing these uniquely charming Nekos to life!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy-to-use semi-auto battles, plus sandbox-style gameplay where you can build your own shop!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy a rhythm game featuring original songs and music videos!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Introduction<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the near future where people live alongside AI-created Nekos—beings that look human, but are just a little different...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while running the patisserie La Soleil with your adorable Nekos, you receive an invitation to the Neko Festival, a global competition where Nekos and their owners vie for popularity!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it the winner will be granted any wish by the Neko-creating AI...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh, cry and grow closer to the Nekos as you uncover the mysteries of the world.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartwarming Neko comedy that connects these felines from all across the globe!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 7 million copies sold worldwide, the latest entry<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in the popular adventure game series NEKOPARA is here!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆About NEKOPARA Sekai Connect (Neko Connect)<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Planning, main story, character design, and illustrations all handled by original creator Sayori herself!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nekos from all around the world appear, each with their own character story!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High-quality 2D animation bringing these uniquely charming Nekos to life!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy-to-use semi-auto battles, plus sandbox-style gameplay where you can build your own shop!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy a rhythm game featuring original songs and music videos!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆Introduction<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the near future where people live alongside AI-created Nekos—beings that look human, but are just a little different...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while running the patisserie La Soleil with your adorable Nekos, you receive an invitation to the Neko Festival, a global competition where Nekos and their owners vie for popularity!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumor has it the winner will be granted any wish by the Neko-creating AI...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh, cry and grow closer to the Nekos as you uncover the mysteries of the world.<\/p>","short_description":"A heartwarming Neko comedy that connects these felines from all across the globe! With over 7 million copies sold worldwide, the latest entry in the popular adventure game series NEKOPARA is here!","supported_languages":"English, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4437450\/d56038a39c03287c9fd867997bf466cf37f4aa82\/header.jpg?t=1795004829","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4437450\/18ffddc85555b1